<title>USA: Ultra Pac COO Laub leaves company.</title>
<headline>Ultra Pac COO Laub leaves company.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultra Pac Inc said Thursday Michael Laub left his post of chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Thomas Rains, a director who was named interim chief operating officer, cited differences in management style as the reason for the departure.  </p>
<p>The company said it has begun a search for a permanent replacement of Laub.</p>
<p>Ultra Pac sells a line of plastic food containers to commercial customers throughout the United States and in overseas markets.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
